<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Defs>

  <!--
    CONTAGION_UNFINISHED_SPAWNER_1 — the_contagion.md §4, "the Unfinished":
    "What the goo buds: chimeras with one design finished and two abandoned —
    three good legs and a stump, one wing, a jaw on a thing that cannot eat.
    Days-long lives, then dissolution back to goo... the most numerous
    creature and the least permanent."

    Shape cloned from this mod's own AmoebaHostUtility/Hediff_AmoebaGestation
    (small utility classes calling vanilla APIs directly) and from
    RM_BlueDesertFauna.xml (ParentName AnimalThingBase + manual race block,
    ordinary custom-animal idiom already used across this repo).

    NOT wired into RM_Contagion.xml's <wildAnimals> — these are not part of
    the biome's ambient breeding wildlife pool (they never reproduce; they
    are budded). CompSpawnerUnfinished (patched onto the donor AA_RedGoo,
    Patches/RedGooSpawnsUnfinished.xml) is the only thing that ever creates
    one, matching "what the goo buds" literally.

    Lifespan: CompProperties_RandomizeUnfinished (on this ThingDef, no patch
    needed since it's our own def) applies RM_UnfinishedUnraveling at a
    randomised initial severity at spawn — a vanilla HediffCompProperties_
    SeverityPerDay ticking to a vanilla lethalSeverity kills the pawn within a
    few in-game days, no custom death-timer class needed.

    Goo dissolve: race.deathAction is vanilla's own DeathActionProperties_Vanish
    (Verse.DeathActionWorker_Vanish) — destroys the corpse outright and drops
    Filth_Slime in its place. Zero new C# needed for "dissolves to goo"; it is
    a declarative vanilla mechanism, the same one already reused by mods for
    "no corpse left" fleshy creatures.

    Art: PLACEHOLDER — a recolored vanilla Warg body (this mod's own
    RM_BlueDesertFauna.xml precedent: "recolored placeholder, no new art"),
    tinted toward the biome's own red-violet/bruise-purple palette
    (infrastructure/artpipe/done/contagion_brossak_*.json's own prompt
    language). infrastructure/artpipe/done/, _artsrc/ and registry.jsonl were
    checked for existing "Unfinished"/"chimera" art before writing this —
    none exists; every hit was unrelated already-cast Contagion creatures
    (brossak/fezzira/ghaaz/etc., DONOR_DEFS_PORT_TO_OURS_1). Real bespoke art
    (the "reads as a draft, asymmetry everywhere" silhouette the sheet's §9
    calls for) is owed work, not blocking; queue via fill_queue.py separately.
  -->

  <ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase">
    <defName>RM_TheUnfinished</defName>
    <label>the Unfinished</label>
    <description>A chimera budded by the Contagion's red goo, one part finished and the rest abandoned mid-thought — three good legs and a stump, maybe a wing that never had anywhere to go, a jaw on a thing that cannot eat. It will not last the week. Most of them are nuisances. A few, wrongly, are not.</description>
    <statBases>
      <MoveSpeed>3.4</MoveSpeed>
      <Mass>18</Mass>
      <MeatAmount>0</MeatAmount>
      <LeatherAmount>0</LeatherAmount>
      <ArmorRating_Sharp>0.05</ArmorRating_Sharp>
      <ArmorRating_Blunt>0.05</ArmorRating_Blunt>
      <ComfyTemperatureMin>0</ComfyTemperatureMin>
      <ComfyTemperatureMax>60</ComfyTemperatureMax>
      <Wildness>1.0</Wildness>
    </statBases>
    <tools>
      <li>
        <label>flailing limb</label>
        <capacities>
          <li>Blunt</li>
        </capacities>
        <power>3</power>
        <cooldownTime>2.6</cooldownTime>
        <linkedBodyPartsGroup>FrontLeftPaw</linkedBodyPartsGroup>
      </li>
    </tools>
    <race>
      <body>QuadrupedAnimalWithPawsAndTail</body>
      <bloodDef>Filth_Slime</bloodDef>
      <baseBodySize>0.55</baseBodySize>
      <baseHealthScale>0.6</baseHealthScale>
      <baseHungerRate>0.5</baseHungerRate>
      <foodType>OmnivoreRoughAnimal</foodType>
      <predator>false</predator>
      <herdAnimal>false</herdAnimal>
      <trainability>None</trainability>
      <petness>0</petness>
      <manhunterOnDamageChance>0.15</manhunterOnDamageChance>
      <lifeExpectancy>1</lifeExpectancy>
      <lifeStageAges>
        <li>
          <def>AnimalAdult</def>
          <minAge>0</minAge>
        </li>
      </lifeStageAges>
      <deathAction Class="DeathActionProperties_Vanish">
        <filth>Filth_Slime</filth>
        <filthCountRange>2~4</filthCountRange>
      </deathAction>
    </race>
    <comps>
      <li Class="RimMandrake.Contagion.CompProperties_RandomizeUnfinished">
        <limbPool>
          <li>RM_UnfinishedClaw</li>
          <li>RM_UnfinishedSpike</li>
          <li>RM_UnfinishedFang</li>
          <li>RM_UnfinishedStump</li>
          <li>RM_UnfinishedVestigialWing</li>
          <li>RM_UnfinishedUselessJaw</li>
        </limbPool>
        <limbCountRange>1~3</limbCountRange>
        <monstrousHediff>RM_UnfinishedMonstrous</monstrousHediff>
        <monstrousChance>0.12</monstrousChance>
        <unravelingHediff>RM_UnfinishedUnraveling</unravelingHediff>
        <unravelingInitialSeverityRange>0~0.5</unravelingInitialSeverityRange>
      </li>
    </comps>
  </ThingDef>

  <PawnKindDef ParentName="AnimalKindBase">
    <defName>RM_TheUnfinished</defName>
    <label>the Unfinished</label>
    <race>RM_TheUnfinished</race>
    <combatPower>25</combatPower>
    <wildGroupSize>1~1</wildGroupSize>
    <ecoSystemWeight>0</ecoSystemWeight>
    <lifeStages>
      <li>
        <bodyGraphicData>
          <texPath>Things/Pawn/Animal/Warg/Warg</texPath>
          <graphicClass>Graphic_Multi</graphicClass>
          <drawSize>0.85</drawSize>
          <color>(168,54,96)</color>
        </bodyGraphicData>
        <dessicatedBodyGraphicData>
          <texPath>Things/Pawn/Animal/Warg/Dessicated_Warg</texPath>
          <drawSize>0.85</drawSize>
        </dessicatedBodyGraphicData>
      </li>
    </lifeStages>
  </PawnKindDef>

</Defs>
